{"ref":"BDB, צֵידָה","hw":"צֵידָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">צֵידָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f.</strong> id.;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">צ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:11\" href=\"/Joshua.9.11\">Jos 9:11</a> + 2 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">צֵדָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 42:25\" href=\"/Genesis.42.25\">Gn 42:25</a> + 5 times;—<em>provision</em> for journey, march, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 42:25\" href=\"/Genesis.42.25\">Gn 42:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 45:21\" href=\"/Genesis.45.21\">45:21</a> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:39\" href=\"/Exodus.12.39\">Ex 12:39</a> (all E), <a data-ref=\"Joshua 1:11\" href=\"/Joshua.1.11\">Jos 1:11</a> (D), <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:11\" href=\"/Joshua.9.11\">9:11</a> (JE), <a data-ref=\"Judges 7:8\" href=\"/Judges.7.8\">Ju 7:8</a> (text dub. cf. GFM), <a data-ref=\"Judges 20:10\" href=\"/Judges.20.10\">20:10</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 22:10\" href=\"/I_Samuel.22.10\">1 S 22:10</a>; <em>supply of food</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:25\" href=\"/Psalms.78.25\">ψ 78:25</a>.—<a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:3\" href=\"/Genesis.27.3\">Gn 27:3</a> v. i. <a data-ref=\"BDB, צַ֫יִד\" href=\"/BDB,_צַ֫יִד\", dir=\"rtl\">צַיִד</a>, sub <a data-ref=\"BDB, צוּד\" href=\"/BDB,_צוּד\", dir=\"rtl\">צוד</a>.","next":"BDB, צִיד","prev":"BDB, צַ֫יִד²"}